            oa:hasSelector [ a oa:TextQuoteSelector ;
                oa:exact "One of the big shortcomings of AI's development approach generally is the lack of trust of pre-made components. It's something that we've been seeing in both the option zero idea, but also in getting sessions to consider the extension of existing features and their slight modification and adaptation as the right way to build something new, instead of taking the constraints that are proposed to a design task and rolling something new within it because that was the only way to perfectly fit what was specified, when in fact a better system would be to slightly change what is specified and leverage the previous work that exists." ;
